# 10 — Repository Map

> Folder layout for **{{project.name}}** (archetype: {{project.archetype}}).

## Top-Level Structure

| Folder | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `context/` | AI navigation — helps agents understand the repo |
| `openspec/` | Specs, proposals, archive — spec-driven development |
| `backend/` | Java/Quarkus code organized by archetype category |
{{#if project.features.frontend}}
| `frontend/` | {{#if (eq project.frontend.platform "both")}}React web + React Native mobile apps{{else if (eq project.frontend.platform "mobile")}}React Native mobile app{{else}}React web app{{/if}} |
{{/if}}
| `deployment/` | Docker, Kubernetes, deployment scripts |

## Backend Structure

{{#if (eq project.archetype "api")}}
```
backend/
└── {{archetypeCategory}}/
    ├── pom.xml                          ← Maven build (Quarkus + persistence)
    ├── contexts/                        ← DDD bounded contexts
    │   └── <context-name>/
    │       ├── domain/                  ← Entities, value objects, events
    │       │   └── GLOSSARY.md          ← Ubiquitous language
    │       ├── application/             ← Commands, queries, handlers
    │       ├── infrastructure/          ← Repos, messaging, persistence
    │       ├── presentation/            ← REST controllers
    │       └── tests/                   ← Unit + integration tests
    └── examples/                        ← CQRS example handlers (delete after use)
```
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq project.archetype "bff-api")}}
```
backend/
└── {{archetypeCategory}}/
    ├── pom.xml                          ← Maven build (Quarkus + REST Client + Messaging, NO persistence)
    ├── contexts/                        ← DDD bounded contexts
    │   └── <context-name>/
    │       ├── domain/                  ← Contracts/interfaces ONLY (no entities, no aggregates)
    │       │   └── GLOSSARY.md          ← Ubiquitous language
    │       ├── application/             ← Command handlers (→ broker), query handlers (→ API clients)
    │       ├── infrastructure/          ← REST API clients, message senders, auth adapters
    │       ├── presentation/            ← REST controllers (frontend-facing), auth middleware
    │       └── tests/                   ← Unit + integration tests
    └── examples/                        ← CQRS example handlers (delete after use)
```
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq project.archetype "microservice")}}
```
backend/
└── {{archetypeCategory}}/
    ├── pom.xml                          ← Maven build (Quarkus + Messaging + persistence)
    ├── contexts/                        ← DDD bounded contexts
    │   └── <context-name>/
    │       ├── domain/                  ← Entities, value objects, events
    │       │   └── GLOSSARY.md          ← Ubiquitous language
    │       ├── application/             ← Command/event handlers, queries
    │       ├── infrastructure/          ← Repos, broker config, event publishers
    │       ├── presentation/            ← Message listeners, optional health endpoints
    │       └── tests/                   ← Unit + integration tests
    └── examples/                        ← CQRS example handlers (delete after use)
```
{{/if}}

## OpenSpec Structure

```
openspec/
├── AGENTS.md                        ← AI agent instructions
├── specs/
│   ├── architecture/                ← DDD, Onion Arch, CQRS rules
│   ├── domain/                      ← Bounded context definitions
│   ├── patterns/                    ← Backend{{#if project.features.frontend}} & frontend{{/if}} patterns
│   ├── project/                     ← Roadmap, MVPs, progress
{{#if project.features.frontend}}
│   ├── toolkit/                     ← React component reference
{{/if}}
│   └── workflow/                    ← Planning, implementation, troubleshooting
├── changes/                         ← Active proposals (REQ-, BUG-, ENH-)
└── archive/                         ← Completed proposals
```

{{#if project.features.frontend}}
